<title>USA: MobileMedia president/CEO resigns.</title>
<headline>MobileMedia president/CEO resigns.</headline>
<dateline>RIDGEFIELD PARK, N.J. 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>MobileMedia Corp said on Tuesday Michael Lorelli announced his intention to resign as the company's president and chief executive officer and as a member on its board of directors.</p>
<p>David Bayer, chairman, will be named acting chief executive officer, the company said. The board would begin an active search for Lorelli's replacement and was continuing its search for senior operations management, MobileMedia said.</p>
